        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Flint Pestle banking trojan sample, as reported in campaign PTF-02081. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Flint Pestle Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-02081)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Flint Pestle Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Flint Pestle banking trojan in campaign PTF-02081.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"92fab14eafa134601ed58b863b175955c1a24974a430d28758e11fcbf0b48572\", \"f701f77f2bb27b90ce015c06771dd6794f5880b503fb6361f2685fcd8a292587\", \"511ae57025a2f3a934754db35d16238253a10823138a4d122e45dbf126a4c5e0\", \"47c23462d459b97bd454ca1b103ecdd8fdf365afdbb6d8146da66cb6ceebac87\", \"91512d373ff7dec50bbb144b70576dec2f31fcb699346853c411158c87e9de7d\", \"ba6f7dfec659ada5f1fc4d6e67953cc271a57ea80b4ec0a1bd5df1c227277648\", \"37507392fb07c3b309f07d24e9af4c1c09e5c36bbcac5016e931f62bc2198b67\", \"99822efb77ad11f3aba0d1932b84c3cf0adbcb2238d52a42442b5ce31f7a6347\", \"ec63325e4d7d7bdb7d18d23484fa58ddb52f30af0a21c81976c4314b80bd6e96\", \"8850d5530429c93f0352dc6de101fda3a3f974c46931d6024db41c58879c11fe\")",
